{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06735","headline":"听弹风入松阕赠杨补阙 · 王昌龄","name":"听弹风入松阕赠杨补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商风入我弦，夜竹深有露。\n弦悲与林寂，清景不可度。\n寥落幽居心，飕飀青松树。\n松风吹草白，溪水寒日暮。\n声意去复还，九变待一顾。\n空山多雨雪，独立君始悟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}